cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use crypto-service-sdk-dotnet in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "crypto-service-sdk-dotnet: typed .NET client for the Crypto Service REST API"
abstract: >-
  A .NET client for the Crypto Service REST API (crypto-server v2):
  hashing, authenticated encryption, signatures, post-quantum key
  encapsulation and signatures, HPKE and KMS operations, performed by
  the server. The client is proven against the server by the Crypto
  Service conformance kit.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
version: "0.0.40"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
